  "annotations": {
    "architecture": "100% wet mono-to-stereo reverb return for an NTS-4 external send/return loop; no dry audio route exists in this Patch. Wash Macro drives HPF frequency, reverb decay, and return level.",
    "midi": "MIDI channel 1, CC 2 drives Wash Macro. The macro opens the return only to raw 32768 (approximately -6 dB), raises HPF frequency, and extends reverb decay.",
